[48.579177, "o", "INVOICE INV-2024-0042                                                issued 2024-10-02\r\nCustomer: Kestrel Analytics Pvt Ltd (GSTIN 29ABCDE1234F1Z5)\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nDescription                                      SAC      Amount        GST      Total\r\nPro (monthly), Oct 2024                       998314    1,499.00     269.82   1,768.82\r\nAdditional seats x3, Oct 2024                 998314      749.25     134.87     884.12\r\nAPI overage, 1,001 calls                      998314      250.25      45.05     295.30\r\nPriority support, Oct 2024                    998314      999.00     179.82   1,178.82\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal                                                                      3,497.50\r\nGST @ 18%                                                                       629.56\r\nTotal due (INR)                                                               4,127.06\r\nINVOICE INV-2024-0107                                                issued 2024-11-14\r\nCustomer: Halcyon Foods LLP (GSTIN 27FGHIJ5678K1Z2)\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nDescription                                      SAC      Amount        GST      Total\r\nPro (annual), 2024-11-14 → 2025-11-14         998314   14,990.00   2,698.20  17,688.20\r\nProration credit: Pro (monthly), 17/30 days   998314     -849.43    -152.90  -1,002.33\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nSubtotal                                                                     14,140.57\r\nGST @ 18%                                                                     2,545.30\r\nTotal due (INR)                                                              16,685.87\r\n"]
